<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What’s the will of God for our days?</l><l>Always rejoice, at all times pray;</l><l>In everything, our thanksgiving</l><l>To God for bountiful blessings!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Turn away, give thanks, yes! Give thanks!</l><l>Never obey what feelings say</l><l>And as we turn, we’ll be released,</l><l>For thanking God has set us free!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
